 comparison workflow topics.\n46\t\n47\t## Acceptance Criteria\n48\t\n49\t- Published documentation covers the comparison workflow from the runs list and from the Model Registry, including the side-by-side and diff views.\n50\t- The documentation covers the workflow for both training runs and pipeline runs.\n51\t- The content is technically reviewed against the implemented behavior of the comparison view, the model version run lineage, and the registry entry point before publication.\n52\t\n53\t## HLR Traceability\n54\t\n55\t- HLR-4 (P2): documentation covers the comparison workflow from both the runs list and the registry.\n56\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bc6bf13b75b0bda6","agent_id":"ad860cbea3ed76465","session_id":"f928a5ef-5578-4e6b-b331-0c0e02acb1a2","uuid":"e9b9420e-7859-4533-b2b5-9414bd8d12f0","timestamp":"2026-10-26T19:00:50.252Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-870af72d5cf5d6f0","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
